#. Crowdin string 490712
msgctxt "AdminUsers|This user has been set to pending approval. Their existing group and project memberships have been preserved and can be restored when seats become available."
msgid "AdminUsers|This user has been set to pending approval. Their existing group and project memberships have been preserved and can be restored when seats become available."
msgstr "Den här användaren har satts till väntande godkännande. Befintliga grupp- och projektmedlemskap har bevarats och kan återställas när platser blir tillgängliga."

#. Crowdin string 500470
msgctxt "Average time from creation to merge, in seconds."
msgid "Average time from creation to merge, in seconds."
msgstr "Genomsnittlig tid från skapande till sammanfogning, i sekunder."

