msgctxt "BillingPlans|Customizable pre-receive Git hooks that enforce commit content standards, message formats, branch naming rules, and file requirements."
msgid "BillingPlans|Customizable pre-receive Git hooks that enforce commit content standards, message formats, branch naming rules, and file requirements."
