#. Crowdin string 264058
msgctxt "Boards|Because this is the only board in this project, when this board is deleted, a new default Development board will be created."
msgid "Boards|Because this is the only board in this project, when this board is deleted, a new default Development board will be created."
msgstr "Eftersom detta är den enda tavlan i projektet skapas en ny standardtavla för utveckling när tavlan tas bort."

#. Crowdin string 113233
msgctxt "Boards|Create new issue"
