msgstr "Visa grenregler"

#. Crowdin string 119931
msgctxt "BroadcastMessages|Leave blank to target all group and project pages."
msgid "BroadcastMessages|Leave blank to target all group and project pages."
msgstr "Lämna tomt för att välja alla grupp- och projektsidor."

#. Crowdin string 116329
msgctxt "Building your merge request… This page will update when the build is complete."
